    "body": "> ...have been throwing around ideas with others, but nothing seems quite right. Something about fundamentals? File basics?\r\n\r\nHere are some other contextually-relevant synonyms:\r\n\r\n- base\r\n- core\r\n- essential\r\n\r\ne.g. `CoreFile(Handle)`\r\n\r\n> Buffers or streams seem tempting, but we're not always dealing with actual buffers or streams.\r\n\r\nBut it is always binary data, right? The [linked IDL](https://github.com/WICG/file-system-access/blob/main/AccessHandle.md#accesshandle-idl) lists properties and methods that deal with byte-oriented data.\r\n\r\ne.g. `FileBytes(Handle)`",
